[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Sign on Tablet
Name[it]=Firma sul tablet
Comment=Sign a PDF with the S Pen on your Galaxy Tab
Comment[it]=Firma un PDF con la S Pen sul tuo Galaxy Tab
Exec=plus-one --sign %F
